{
  "_comment": "Purpose-based search tasks. expect_top5: at least one must rank in the top 5 (meets first, then needs-verification). expect_group pins where a record must land. never_meets: tempting results that must not appear as confirmed matches.",
  "queries": [
    {
      "id": "routewatch",
      "q": "I need traffic incident data for RouteWatch. It should have latitude, longitude, and timestamps, cover at least one year, and be available as CSV.",
